Planning and Development Department
2101 O’NeiI Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282 (Fax) 307-637-6366
II
MEMO
To:
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
From:
Jeanie Vetter, Parks and Greenway Planner
Subject:
Grant of Access and Temporary Construction Easement on City Owned Property
Date:
July 26, 2021
Background:
The item for consideration is a grant of access easement and temporary construction easement across
City owned property. Tract U, Sweetgrass, 2uid Filing was dedicated to the City for public greenway
purposes. The adjacent property owner to the south, Lots 100 and 200, Block 15, of Sweetgrass, 6th
Filing require access to the site from the right-of-way along Murray Road.
The Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral 07/26/2021
•
Public Services Committee 08/02/2021
•
Final Reading 08/09/202 1
Attachments:
1.
Grant of Access Easement
2.
