```text
Approved as to
form oni :
GRANT OF ACCESS EASEMENT
e•_//f
KNOW ALL MEN BY THESE PRESENTS that, for and in consideration of the sum of
one dollar ($1.00) and other valuable consideration in hand paid, the receipt and adequacy of
which is hereby acknowledged, the City of Cheyenne, a municipal corporation organized under
the laws of the State of Wyoming, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001, hereinafter
referred to as CITY or GRANTOR, owner in fee simple of Tract U, Sweetgrass, 2’ Filing, City
of Cheyenne, Lararnie County, Wyoming (a designated Greenway Open Space Parcel), does
hereby grant, remise, and relinquish unto Sweetgrass Land Co., LLC, its heirs, successors, and
assignees, hereinafter referred to as GRANTEE, the non-exclusive right, privilege, authority, and
easement for lands owned by GRANTOR, or in which GRANTOR has any interest, further
described as follows:
ACCESS EASEMENT
A 60 foot wide access, utility, drainage, and public right-of-way easement to
serve a portion of the NE1/4 of Section 16, Township 13 North, Range 66 West,
of the 6th P.M., AKA “Parcel CC” Sweetgrass PUD, in the City of Cheyenne,
Laramie County, Wyoming, said parcel to be known as Sweetgrass, 6th Filing, and
containing 12.83 acres, more or less.
Said easement being more particularly described as extending 30 feet on either
side of the following described centerline:
Beginning at a point on the North line of Block 15, Sweetgrass,
6th Filing
(coincident with the South line of said Tract U) from which the Northeast corner
of said Tract U bears S. 7I00727 E., a distance of 639.14 feet; thence N.
22°29’21” E., a distance of 40.28 feet to the South right-of-way line of East
Murray Road and said easement there terminates.
The boundary lines of said easement shall be lengthened or shortened to maintain
a continuous 60 foot wide access easement from said North line of Block 15 to
said South right-of-way line of East Murray Road.
Said easement containing 2,401 square feet, more or less.
See Exhibit A, attached hereto and incorporated herein by reference.
TEMPORARY CONSTRUCTION EASEMENT
A 20 foot wide temporary construction easement of those lands being a portion of
the NE1/4 of Section 16, Township 13 North, Range 66 West, of the 6th P.M.,
AKA “Parcel CC” Sweetgrass PUD, in the City of Cheyenne, Laramie County,
Wyoming, said parcel to be known as Sweetgrass, 6th Filing, and containing 12.83
acres, more or less.
Said easement being more particularly described as follows:
A 20 foot wide temporary construction easement on each side of the access
easement described above to accommodate construction of properly permitted
utilities and roadway improvements within the access easement.
Said temporary
construction easement is more particularly described as extending 50 feet on each
side of the above-described centerline.
