### Page 4 of 5

```text
The GRANTEE releases and agrees to save and hold harmless GRANTOR, its officers,
agents, and employees, from any causes of action or claims or demands arising out of this grant
of access easement, except to the extent any such cause of action or claims or demands are the
result of the negligence or willful misconduct of the GRANTOR, its agents, or employees.
Included in this grant shall be the right to lay, construct, maintain, operate, alter, repair,
remove, change the size of, and replace at any time the assets laid by GRANTEE.
This grant is a covenant running with the land and shall be binding upon the parties
hereto, their heirs, devisees, representatives, successors, and assigns; and the rights, privileges
and authorities herein granted shall be assignable together or separately and in whole or in part.
